The Generals ZH card, rewritten per PLAN §1: left selects (never orders,
empty ground does nothing), right commands (context: attack / gather /
move / rally) with the 6 px click-vs-drag threshold, right-drag scrolls,
middle-drag rotates, the 14 px depth-scaled edge band, shift+click /
shift+box / double-click, groups with double-tap centering, Space's
jump, the Escape ladder, and the unchanged wheel/Q/E/P/F3/F8/R set.

Both copies update together (PLAYTEST §2 is the README paragraph,
verbatim, by its own rule) — the re-test plays against this card.
---
